0)` or of `P(pw ≤ k)`; the planted measure is the *right* measure","+for the cluster question precisely because it is tilted by `X`. No","+pathwidth is computed: the planted pair makes `X ≥ 1` by construction and","+the pathwidth of a planted instance is irrelevant to the question.","+","+**Two identities, used throughout** (both from exchangeability of the","+vertex labels, which `G(n, p)` and the uniform-pattern cover model have;","+both checked exactly against enumeration in `tests/test_separator_moment.py`):","+","+1. `E[X² ] = Σ_P P(P empty) · E[X | P empty] = E[X] · E[X | P₀ empty]`, so","+   **`E[X′ | P₀ empty] = E[X²]/E[X] − 1`** — the planted mean is the","+   second-moment ratio times the unconditional mean, computed exactly at","+   the cell's `(n, t, r)` by the `3 × 3` overlap sum (`planted_mean_gnp`,","+   `planted_mean_cover`; `second_moment_exact_cover` is the general-`r`","+   form of `second_moment_exact`, pinned to it at `r = t − 1`). Checked","+   against a simulation of the planted law at `n = 9`","+   (`test_planted_mean_is_the_mean_of_the_other_pairs_on_gnp`).","+2. `Σ_P 1[P empty] / X = 1[X > 0]`, so **`P(X > 0) / E[X] = E[1/X | P₀","+   empty]`** — the whole slack of the union bound at a cell is the mean of","+   `1/X` under the planted law, a bounded statistic that 200 planted","+   instances estimate with a standard error of `0.01–0.03`, where the mean","+   of `X` itself is dominated by the tail. Checked on every labelled graph","+   at `n = 6` (`test_planted_inverse_mean_is_the_union_bound_slack`).","+","+**The events counted.** On `G(n, c/n)`: delete every `A–R` edge of a","+fresh graph for a fixed `A` (`|A| = t`) and `R` (`|R| = r = N − t`), which","+is exactly the conditional law. On covers at `(6, 1)`: `m = n` patterns,","+each a uniform 6-set conditioned to meet at most one side (rejection","+sampling; acceptance 0.28–0.43), which is exactly the conditional law","+of the i.i.d.-pattern model of `CliqueCoverMoment.lean` (not the","+ensemble's `fixed` generator, which repairs empty rows). `X` is the number","+of ordered exact-size empty pairs (item 03's enumerator); `X′ = X − 1`;","+for every other pair its `3 × 3` overlap table with `P₀` (`overlap_table`),","+its Hamming distance `d = n − |A ∩ A′| − |R ∩ R′| − |S ∩ S′|` from `P₀`,","+and the same distance from the *reversed* planted pair `(R, A)`, which is","+itself an exact-size empty pair whenever `N` is even (`has_reverse`) and","+sits at distance `N`; \"far\" means `d > 0.2 n`. `X₂`, `X₃`, `X₃′`, `X₄` and","+the move-class of `P₀` as in §3.","+","+### 4.1 Instances","+","+| model | cells | per cell | instances | `k` |","+|---|---|---|---|---|","+| planted `G(n, c/n)` | `n ∈ {16, 20, 24, 28, 32}` × `c ∈ {6, 10}` × `β ∈ {β*(c), β*(c) + 0.1}` | 200 | 4,000 | `round(β n)`; `β*(6) = 0.1706`, `β*(10) = 0.3371` (`beta_star_gnp`, the root of `H(a, a, 1 − 2a) − c a²`) |","+| planted covers `(6, 1)` | `n ∈ {16, 20, 24, 28}` × `β ∈ {β*, β* + 0.1}` | 200 | 1,600 | `β*(6, 1) = 0.5132` (`beta_star`) |","+","+Seeds `crc32(\"sep04:{source}:{n}:{c}:{β label}:{i}\")`; the planted sides are","+the first `t` and the next `r` vertices. The realised `β = k/n` is in the","+table below (rounding moves it by up to `0.03`); every prediction uses the","+realised `(n, t, r)`. The whole run is **305 s on 8 workers at nice 19**","+(0.6 core-hours against 3 budgeted); 7 instances of the 5,600 are censored","+(more than 2 million pairs, `G(32, 6/32)` at `β* + 0.1`) and enter the","+medians as \"above the cap\", the means without them (which biases those two","+means down), and `E[1/X]` as zero.","+","+### 4.2 The table: median against mean against prediction","+","+Per cell; `gm` is the geometric mean over `X′ > 0`; `E[X′ | planted]` is","+identity 1 at the realised sizes; the last column is the asymptotic","+exponent `sup − g(a)` of `second_moment_rate_gnp` / `second_moment_rate`","+at `a = (1 − β)/2`, for reference only. (`cells.csv`.)","+","+| model | `β` | `n` | `k` | 